@startuml
title Notification State Diagram
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false

state Pending
state Sent : entry / attempts++, sentAt = now
state Failed : entry / attempts++

[*] --> Pending : SendDeadlineRemindersAsync() [deadline not completed]
Pending --> Sent : SendAsync() [email sent] / MarkSent()
Pending --> Failed : SendAsync() [email failed] / MarkFailed()
Failed --> Sent : RetryAsync() [email sent] / MarkSent()
Failed --> Failed : RetryAsync() [email failed] / MarkFailed(), return 502
Sent --> [*]

Sent -[#red]-> Sent : <color:red>RetryAsync() [not Failed] / reject 400 INVALID_TRANSITION</color>
Pending -[#red]-> Pending : <color:red>RetryAsync() [not Failed] / reject 400 INVALID_TRANSITION</color>

@enduml
